---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ConceptImage from '../components/ConceptImage.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import { services } from '../data/site';
export function getStaticPaths() { return services.map(service => ({ params: { service: service.slug }, props: { service } })); }
const { service } = Astro.props;
---
<BaseLayout title={`${service.name} in Bryan–College Station, TX`} description={`${service.name} in Bryan, College Station, and Brazos County. Discuss your ideas, existing plans, and project-specific design assistance with M&H Construction.`}>
  <section class="container page-intro"><a class="breadcrumb" href="/">Home</a><span class="breadcrumb"> / {service.short}</span><p class="eyebrow">{service.name.toUpperCase()} · BRAZOS COUNTY</p><h1>{service.headline}</h1><p class="intro-text">{service.intro}</p><a class="button" href={`/contact/?service=${service.short === 'Kitchens' ? 'Kitchen' : 'Bathroom'}`}>Discuss Your {service.short === 'Kitchens' ? 'Kitchen' : 'Bathroom'} <Arrow /></a></section>
  <div class="container"><ConceptImage src={service.image} alt={service.alt} class="page-image" eager /></div>
  <section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">LET’S BEGIN WITH YOU</p><h2>Planning Your<br /><em>Remodel.</em></h2></div><p>Every home and every project is different. These are a few useful starting points for our first conversation.</p></div><div class="process-grid">{service.priorities.map((priority, index) => <article><span class="step-number">0{index + 1}</span><h3>{priority}</h3><p>{index === 0 ? 'Tell us what you enjoy now and what you would like to improve.' : index === 1 ? 'Consider how you move through the space and what would make it easier to use.' : 'Bring inspiration that captures the look and feel you have in mind.'}</p></article>)}</div><p class="scope-note">Specific services, specialist work, timing, and pricing are discussed and confirmed for your individual project.</p></section>
  <section class="approach-section"><div class="container approach-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">PLANS IN HAND OR IDEAS IN MIND</p><h2>Ideas, plans &amp;<br /><em>design guidance.</em></h2></div><div><p class="large-copy">Bring the vision you have. We’ll talk through the next step together.</p><p>M&amp;H can work from your ideas or plans, with design assistance tailored to the project. You do not need every detail figured out before you reach out.</p><a class="text-link" href="/our-process/">See Our Process <Arrow /></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section container faq-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR QUESTIONS, ANSWERED</p><h2>Before your remodel.</h2></div><FAQ items={service.questions} /></section>
  <ContactCTA />
</BaseLayout>
